                  <nc xml:id="m-20240e1f-1acd-47d0-a186-431bd6a56cd5" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-3efb7d13-badc-4e9b-97b3-7316d61354a9">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-581622f4-84a8-4fde-a069-ce628b9ea718" type="punctum" xml:id="m-cd6010d3-78e3-4ee7-84e0-cdcb02cf37f9">
                  <nc xml:id="m-7a90f059-6ba7-4642-850c-60d7810c8e3a" pname="b" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-8fa3a46e-0715-496e-ae73-543dcf8f26f8" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-742b0249-6a81-4780-be8a-4c2043dd3c9c" facs="#m-60d3ee99-84dc-407d-8d8b-51afc97483cc" form="maxima" /><divLine xml:id="m-5b1bbc56-fa30-4258-8b1e-6e26b35bcb18" facs="#m-611d1e69-5ebe-4c8b-be15-5d49a0569916" form="maxima" /><syllable xml:id="m-4545a33d-0c1a-4cd7-8d81-00666e429ae7">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-a97bbc2e-900d-4b87-bd53-2f85a6bc96ea" type="punctum" xml:id="m-038230e6-c8d6-41e1-91f8-9ea7f301bd61">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ccb526d7-6bcb-4e0f-94e5-25d5d71ef436" pname="d" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d22ad51f-59c0-45b7-bc97-17abb56c1b4f">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-55e80639-eb6b-4a6b-b2f2-2975dcf2ab8a" type="punctum" xml:id="m-4eb2a551-befb-4260-9c9c-999ec47f2fcc">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e3f6defc-86b2-46d5-bcf6-335b224c5b68" pname="d" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d1c4b4ca-54b3-47a6-b893-53b06e3fc206">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-025d50e9-b78d-4781-854d-abb528dfe54d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-f6254745-92a9-4ffb-b807-9317e65c41ce">
                  <nc xml:id="m-7903dc21-cf15-41a3-a7b5-057c53baf77b" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-ae5f0912-c717-41d3-9c9f-445fc7f5ead3">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-b1941003-7984-4a33-9395-e26c72d1fab9" type="punctum" xml:id="m-fbcf7d7b-0496-4ec8-b93e-fe330f2baa2a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-6de604fd-53a0-4952-99e7-275859b2a799" pname="c" oct="4">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-c4384dae-e3ed-4519-af09-14e9e87b1612" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-2a46936f-3cd4-4507-97dd-79ca6e41fe73">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-6104bcdc-3261-41f7-9ef4-dbe62ebc023c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8ad7909b-3c81-4c86-8394-88ff5e66b0a4">
                  <nc xml:id="m-5d5912c0-9f80-491b-bcc7-f4c3c4b2c492" pname="d" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-e390a45c-72c3-4cc3-8840-be4660fdb360">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-58435789-e1bc-4d88-8b44-d02b649b7856" type="punctum" xml:id="m-25d7d0b5-599a-4d8b-b4da-d05427b7f84b">
                  <nc xml:id="m-6fb9b5d0-1582-45bc-8a5e-42040a6f0dcd" pname="d" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-750a74a5-07a3-4da7-ae78-bbe3f0105f31">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-1e6ddd9e-b526-4105-a259-ee6182c9f716" type="punctum" xml:id="m-2172ba55-929c-4e81-ab55-c5a33b7eb159">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e048967d-b532-4021-a1ab-9c735952a2c2" pname="d" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-5e9879a6-19a7-4fd0-aeb5-5e79e865c074" facs="#m-c60606ec-7147-4939-a00c-696ccc9c6c7b" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d891967f-1f59-4f77-b4fd-cf9411f16351"><lg xml:id="m-3eff3d0f-a783-43c3-b03b-263759f52f10"><l xml:id="m-b6c845ba-7de3-4745-89f1-6b9d79de3893" facs="#m-14efb361-813b-4eee-ae82-75dc1712ef31" label="ambiguous">Psalm 63</l><l xml:id="m-974e5593-2d0b-4eb0-bd33-dc76e33a9446" facs="#m-00e42127-2fc3-4d30-a5b6-5b78a92eea90" label="ambiguous">e32</l><l xml:id="m-6c5446b1-7d0d-44c8-80dd-affafc50dabf" facs="#m-4f6f236b-a844-4378-b6a8-a22a7cc12962" label="lyrics-like">2. Annuntiáre máne misericórdiam túam* et fidelitátem túam per</l><l xml:id="m-c27f1f49-9541-438f-9a6e-ec8a95023e7c" facs="#m-d212cd1e-ee78-4e53-a730-d750efbf74c8" label="lyrics-like">nóctes.</l><l xml:id="m-c62612d9-a2cd-4a23-a47e-5168aa5cce97" facs="#m-fef3df2e-a6d5-4cab-8f8a-a70ed2a27040" label="lyrics-like">3. Psaltério decachórdo et Iyra, * cum cántico ad citharam.</l><l xml:id="m-9d7df162-ea20-4641-927b-6336356be9e2" facs="#m-faf43e74-c5d5-4dd8-a068-29f132f0a375" label="lyrics-like">4. Nam me deléctas, Dómine, fáctis túis, * de opéribus mánuum</l><l xml:id="m-7357429d-3342-44c7-b43d-9d856ae2266b" facs="#m-ab89d83c-f20d-45c3-9091-742bcec14e30" label="lyrics-like">tuárum exsúlto.—</l><l xml:id="m-ba0ebdf8-d5a9-4d83-8114-881b6dc317d8" facs="#m-be27eb99-5043-46eb-b2af-936678dddd77" label="lyrics-like">5. Quam magnífica sunt ópera túa, Dómine, * quam profúndae cogi¬</l><l xml:id="m-dca6115d-3231-4c08-a9cd-9c111ad05ef6" facs="#m-6be9c984-75f5-4537-b100-d1497c4aa9f7" label="lyrics-like">tatiónes túae!</l><l xml:id="m-0ebfdd9e-2601-4bbd-935b-8686c08b0ad8" facs="#m-adc0a671-db14-45ee-8abe-c98f08279333" label="lyrics-like">6. Vir insipiens non cognóscit, *et stúltus non intélligit haec.</l><l xml:id="m-21d8cf8b-f978-4d2c-88f3-ff576afb68a7" facs="#m-32a2b643-47b9-4ab9-9636-d06c2390de06" label="lyrics-like">7. Etsi impii flóreant ut hérba, * et spléndeant ômnes mále agéntes,</l><l xml:id="m-e8d6b8dd-ca34-4cbb-8b20-4d9eff6250fc" facs="#m-c6342125-0df9-4f95-93ff-2f1e57f2c0fe" label="lyrics-like">8. Excidio destinántur sempitérno: *tu autem in aetérnum excélsus</l><l xml:id="m-c904928f-5bc8-41da-bcfc-487cda302930" facs="#m-5a39b54a-b88d-4ce4-b061-906e25fedc7e" label="lyrics-like">es, Dómine.—</l><l xml:id="m-acc88c91-04ba-4824-b869-2b864a0b3cb4" facs="#m-ab461386-6a6d-482b-a360-b9c01f0bdc10" label="lyrics-like">9. Nam ecce inimici túi, Dómine, f nam ecce inimici túi peribunt:</l><l xml:id="m-f1f9fd16-f507-463a-b21c-a4234f8aac89" facs="#m-0dd5f81f-7723-45cf-ae3b-f1947c427882" label="lyrics-like">dispergéntur ómnes mále agéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-c135e32c-0de4-4b4e-8598-a4af44e93678" facs="#m-2c544298-405e-41e0-8ece-dbf3db0a60cd" label="lyrics-like">10. Extulisti sicut córnu búbali córnu méum;*perfudisti me óleo</l><l xml:id="m-ac6dda69-8401-4b25-aac4-1d87847ff4dd" facs="#m-75a6ee1c-91d3-43b2-8f4d-7e930752edcd" label="lyrics-like">puríssimo.</l><l xml:id="m-03bb812c-e9c1-4cee-a4eb-c4096ab04242" facs="#m-a1711af6-bdb8-455d-b4f9-8911b9468a3b" label="lyrics-like">11. Et óculus méus despéxit inimícos méos, f et de insurgéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-6e770a46-2a69-4f01-918d-678c9b50f2bb" facs="#m-ecff9dbf-0aff-44b6-8e9d-0636cd2ac007" label="lyrics-like">contra me malignis * laéta audiérunt aures méae.—</l><l xml:id="m-38e5d02a-fa5b-430a-80d8-661cefb82179" facs="#m-505d693e-2407-4d0e-81c8-928af92761c7" label="lyrics-like">12. Jústus ut pálma florébit, *sicut cédrus Libani créscet.</l><l xml:id="m-aa3a675e-b5ba-48a1-abde-b386fc95ff14" facs="#m-0948f32d-2826-4989-836f-c64cbe166f50" label="lyrics-like">13. Plantáti in dómo Dómini, * in átriis Déi nóstri florébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-94c7fbf7-9415-4f67-9dcb-44245bbf9020" facs="#m-baeb448d-d6af-4021-973a-aed7d9064881" label="lyrics-like">14. Frúctum férent étiam in senectûte, *sucósi et végeti érunt,</l><l xml:id="m-8c31b02a-5bed-4633-bd47-d6ff46b7cb15" facs="#m-b4525c8b-10e8-4310-afc3-15c6517c0158" label="lyrics-like">15. Ut annúntient, quam réctus sit Dóminus, Pétra méa, * neque</l><l xml:id="m-8d6cdeb9-9992-4fbb-aeb6-ffbb6509bc7d" facs="#m-917613e6-7648-48d8-95e6-2b177ea04e38" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátem ésse in éo.</l><l xml:id="m-47f2ae17-c8ca-41de-aacc-fcf1cb4c0a6a" facs="#m-5b78651d-1678-410b-85f3-bf5553f206f8" label="ambiguous">Psalm 63</l><l xml:id="m-250bf50e-b246-447f-8c95-49a904a1ca09" facs="#m-e8a37e5b-97e7-4e43-8dad-4268bc90c625" label="lyrics-like">1. Audi, Dé-us, vócem mé-am, dum qué¬ ror;* a timóre in-imi-ci cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c69bf4a3-836b-455c-b3b9-3f066c5f6b89" facs="#m-0e9f7984-d868-4552-8f84-b54748bacd14" label="lyrics-like">stódi vi¬ tam mé- am. Flex : rem má¬ lam, f</l><l xml:id="m-d0fe0ec3-e4df-4183-a377-ea54a7302c43" facs="#m-5469a9a7-f351-48b3-974e-27d55181a722" label="lyrics-like">2. Prótege me a concilio malignórum, *a tumúltu agéntium iniqua,</l><l xml:id="m-a5d38cd7-902f-469a-b95d-da0475f5e24b" facs="#m-c27c599f-8108-4f23-aec7-f09ec3462324" label="lyrics-like">3. Qui ácuunt ut gládium linguas súas, * dirigunt ut sagittas vérba</l><l xml:id="m-da81fc7e-9f55-4abd-9e20-9da7416390b3" facs="#m-d467ff1d-138e-489d-805e-c384e4f5128d" label="lyrics-like">venenáta,</l><l xml:id="m-2b333664-bbc6-4ec4-8b1c-831fb0f238d7" facs="#m-28b669bb-d7cf-46c5-89c3-148bfe2650f7" label="lyrics-like">4. Ut fériant ex látebris innocéntem, * de improviso fériant éum</l><l xml:id="m-7bc86065-c48f-4150-a517-315dcba394d8" facs="#m-1c481276-006a-4c05-96c9-9cb631f7800d" label="lyrics-like">nihil timéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-ed59400c-db19-4ef4-a4cc-7ee7522de86b" facs="#m-1c863764-fd7f-4907-b6ed-af2a3aa97591" label="lyrics-like">5. Firmiter propónunt sibi rem málam, l conspirant de láqueis tendéndis</l><l xml:id="m-50956f07-8c2d-4eb8-bbb5-684c72543c6b" facs="#m-d4095080-27cd-41f8-94ad-bc825e807fdc" label="lyrics-like">occulte, * dicunt : «Quis éos vidébit?»</l><l xml:id="m-13919bd7-67ab-4ba7-83ec-a51e286ee25e" facs="#m-324e502e-a21c-49f1-bc8f-8cfadd8950a1" label="lyrics-like">6. Excógitant nefária, f occúltant cogitatiónes excogitátas, * et mens</l><l xml:id="m-e5fc0b4f-0c19-410a-990a-bf7c1dce9d00" facs="#m-90677b43-15e1-4466-b84f-41e4b523d44d" label="lyrics-like">cujúsque et cor súnt profúnda.—</l><l xml:id="m-9aac1d86-1e6e-4319-b64b-cd946dc5c11a" facs="#m-449967e4-110d-4bf3-8b23-d06fa40a1d57" label="lyrics-like">7. Sed Déus férit éos sagittis, a de improviso percutiúntur vulnéribus,</l><l xml:id="m-d4c79f9f-809a-4872-bf65-98338c018349" facs="#m-12c42c92-6e8e-4cc1-b664-dad2ffeb87a8" label="lyrics-like">8. Et ruinam párat éis lingua ipsórum: * cápita móvent ómnes qui</l><l xml:id="m-118d6f14-68b0-40d2-a600-78850104d7ce" facs="#m-2839d7b9-0435-49be-a748-8ac3ee394a08" label="lyrics-like">vident éos.</l><l xml:id="m-60bf5998-a819-4846-b352-7ca189341635" facs="#m-973b36a3-03d3-4c12-b8b3-eb322e598afa" label="lyrics-like">9. Et ómnes tíment et praédicant ópus Déi, * et perpéndunt ácta</l><l xml:id="m-dc59bb89-d4bd-480d-9126-2b2348835d54" facs="#m-1f00fa9d-3106-4932-8f93-e4f066d5bb85" label="lyrics-like">éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-e6fb8cbf-42d9-4302-b65e-d4513eb9fe5f" facs="#m-17e2cc9c-7c9e-4efb-8293-e94eca553de2" label="lyrics-like">10. Lactátur jústus in Dómino et cónfugit ad éum, *et gloriántur</l><l xml:id="m-394db292-3aad-47f7-9b8a-6b9d0e61c511" facs="#m-26845c1d-4811-4b80-a5fb-97fc37fd30ab" label="lyrics-like">omnes récti córde.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>